        <mxCell id="q6-t" value="6. uart_rx: lọc 2/3, phát hiện start, FSM IDLE → START → DATA → [PARITY] → STOP" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
